        "original_id": "2868aef1-2448-5d5d-ba0a-4f67c3ecca68",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Marijus Adomaitis, Ten Walls, Mario Basanov\n- Products: \"Walking with Elephants\"\n- Places: Ibiza, Lithuania, United Kingdom\n- Topics: stage names, chart performance, popularity\n\nFacts:\n- Marijus Adomaitis was born on 19 January 1983.\n- Marijus Adomaitis is a Lithuanian producer who uses the stage names Ten Walls and Mario Basanov.\n- In 2014, Marijus Adomaitis released the single \"Walking with Elephants\" under the name Ten Walls.\n- In 2014, \"Walking with Elephants\" was one of the most popular songs in Ibiza.\n- In 2014, \"Walking with Elephants\" peaked at number 6 on the UK Singles Chart.\n- \"Walking with Elephants\" is the work for which Marijus Adomaitis is best known.",
